2\"></path></svg> LawnsGuide</a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/70 max-w-xs leading-relaxed\">Expert lawn care, landscaping, and gardening guides to help you grow a beautiful outdoor space.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-white/80\">Categories</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/lawn-care\">Lawn Care</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/landscaping\">Landscaping</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/pest-control\">Pest Control</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/categories/tree-care\">Tree Care</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 text-white/80\">Quick Links</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog\">All Articles</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/authors\">Our Authors</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-white/10\"><div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 text-xs text-white/50\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> LawnsGuide. All rights reserved.</div></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0~7h.1hqdbnou.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[79520,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mkh1ezli734p.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[98840,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mkh1ezli734p.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[70119,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0mkh